## **Highest-leverage next 30 minutes: lock these five factions as the political backbone of Campaign 1**

**Locked.** These five give us a very clean narrative ecosystem without prematurely revealing the AI/alien forces.

| Faction           | Core motivation                  | What they naturally provide                                    |
