| 💰 **Trade**      | Resources + economic opportunity | Commerce, contracts, prices, routes, wealth                    |
| 🏴‍☠️ **Pirates** | Freedom + exploitation           | Smuggling, raids, black markets, independence                  |
| ⛏️ **Mining**     | Frontier resources               | Extraction, colonies, rare materials, frontier access          |
| 🛡️ **Military**  | Strategic control                | Security, weapons, classified intelligence, restricted systems |
| 🔬 **Science**    | Understanding the anomalies      | Research, exploration, anomaly technology, ancient evidence    |

### The important part

These shouldn't just be five groups with different uniforms.

They should have **fundamentally different answers to one question:**

> **"What should humanity do with the impossible frontier?"**

| Faction       | Their answer                                        |
| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| 💰 Trade      | **Exploit its economic potential.**                 |
| 🏴‍☠️ Pirates | **Nobody owns it. Take what you can.**              |
| ⛏️ Mining     | **Extract its resources and build civilization.**   |
| 🛡️ Military  | **Control it before someone else does.**            |
| 🔬 Science    | **Understand it before anyone interferes with it.** |

That creates natural conflict **without requiring an evil faction**.

