# 🧩 The really interesting part: what each faction knows

I recommend that **no faction has the complete truth**.

Instead:

```text
                THE ANOMALY
                     │
       ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
       │             │             │
     TRADE         PIRATES       MINING
       │             │             │
    WHO PROFITS    WHERE IT IS   WHAT IT DOES
       │             │             │
       └─────────────┼─────────────┘
                     │
              ┌──────┴──────┐
              │             │
           MILITARY       SCIENCE
              │             │
          THREAT/RISK    HOW IT WORKS
```

And even those are **not necessarily completely correct**.

That's crucial.

A faction can give the player genuine information while still misunderstanding what it means.

