```

But let's make the relationships more specific.

| Relationship     | Dynamic                                      |
| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| Mara ↔ Darius    | Business partners with competing interests   |
| Mara ↔ Rook      | Public enemies, privately respect each other |
| Mara ↔ Ordan     | Constant negotiation                         |
| Mara ↔ Elara     | Wants access to scientific discoveries       |
| Darius ↔ Rook    | Frontier allies when convenient              |
| Darius ↔ Ordan   | Constant dispute over military interference  |
| Darius ↔ Elara   | Extraction vs preservation                   |
| Rook ↔ Ordan     | Deep ideological hatred                      |
| Rook ↔ Elara     | Unexpected mutual fascination                |
| Ordan ↔ Elara    | Military wants classified research           |
| Elara ↔ everyone | Knows something they're all missing          |

