# 8. THE FIRST CHARACTER WHO SHOULD REALLY WORRY THE PLAYER

## **Tovin**

Don't make Tovin obviously supernatural.

That's too easy.

Instead:

The player eventually shows Tovin a piece of anomaly data.

Tovin looks at it.

And says:

> **"That's not where it was last time."**

Player:

> "Last time?"

Tovin pauses.

> **"I mean... last time the system was mapped."**

The player moves on.

But the audience remembers.

