# 🧠 THE MOST IMPORTANT IMPLEMENTATION RULE

Notice what we **didn't** do.

We didn't create:

```text
TraderCampaign.js
PirateCampaign.js
MiningCampaign.js
MilitaryCampaign.js
ScienceCampaign.js
```

Instead:

```text
Mission
   ↓
Player State
   ↓
Faction State
   ↓
Knowledge State
   ↓
World State
   ↓
Available Missions
```

That lets one mission respond dynamically.

For example:

> **THE WITNESS**

can have different dialogue depending on:

```text
player_background
faction_rep
knowledge_flags
npc_trust
previous_choices
```

That gives you **replayability without multiplying the entire content base.**

