# 34. BRANCHING ARCHITECTURE

This is the rule that will save us from creating a development nightmare.

### ❌ Do NOT build:

```text
Choice A
 ├── 12 missions
 │    ├── 8 missions
 │    └── 9 missions
Choice B
 ├── 15 missions
 ...
```

That becomes a hydra.

### ✅ Build:

```text
BRANCH
   ↓
CONSEQUENCE
   ↓
NEW INFORMATION / ACCESS
   ↓
BOTTLENECK
   ↓
RECONVERGENCE
   ↓
NEXT BRANCH
```

Example:

```text
Give anomaly data to Trade
        ↓
Trade gains knowledge
        ↓
Science doesn't
        ↓
Trade gives player access
        ↓
Player discovers something
        ↓
All factions converge
        ↓
New choice
```

Your choice matters.

But the game remains buildable.

