# 15. IMPORTANT ENGINE RULE: KNOWLEDGE ≠ UNLOCK

This is worth locking now.

For example:

```text
knowledge.network_topology = true
```

does **not** automatically mean:

```text
science_rep += 50
```

And:

```text
knowledge.ancient_structure_found = true
```

doesn't mean every faction suddenly knows about it.

Instead:

```text
PLAYER KNOWS
       ↓
PLAYER DECIDES WHETHER TO SHARE
       ↓
FACTION KNOWS
       ↓
FACTION ACTS
       ↓
WORLD CHANGES
```

That creates an actual strategic information system.

