# 18. ONE VERY IMPORTANT CHANGE TO YOUR EXISTING GAME

If your current mission system only supports:

```text
mission
→ objective
→ reward
```

we need to expand it to:

```text
MISSION
 ↓
OBJECTIVES
 ↓
PLAYER CHOICE
 ↓
EFFECTS
 ├── Reputation
 ├── Trust
 ├── Knowledge
 ├── World State
 ├── Access
 └── Future Missions
 ↓
RECONVERGENCE
```

That is the **minimum narrative engine** required for *The Wrong Map*.

You don't need a giant RPG dialogue engine.

You need a **state-change engine**.

